Use scene called "TerrainScene"
Click Build / Play button
Player needs to get past two standing guards in order to free their fleeing friends
You will get 15 shots; if you run out of bullets, but all the enemies aren't dead, you will lose
Move with WASD, shoot by clicking
Use Esc to leave game
Note: I disabled the Film Grain and depth of field because they made my eyes hurt
Note: I redid the UI pause menu a slightly different way because I was getting bugs with how the textbook was telling me to do things